@startuml class-harvest-sync
!include elvira.iuml
' =============================================================================
' What: one connector contract and registry in apps/harvest; OAI-PMH and MARC
'       files are connectors in the app, Dataverse registers its own from
'       apps/dataverse; a source using a writing connector may run in `sync`
'       mode, whose merge base is the HarvestRecord itself (synced_record),
'       so there is no system-specific sync model and apps/harvest names no
'       system.
' Kind: UML class diagram, proposal (IP-034, accepted, unified 2026-11-16).
'       Scope: new models, the connector contract, the core columns they use.
'       Omitted: OaiRecord (class-oai-record).
' Source: EvilFlowersCatalog IP-034 decisions (2026-11-16);
'         apps/core/models/{entry,catalog,category}.py, apps/tasks (IP-031).
' =============================================================================

title Harvesting and two-way sync: one connector contract (IP-034, unified, 2026-11-16)

package "apps.core (existing, new columns)" as core {
  class Entry {
    identifiers : hstore [isbn, doi, issn, ccnb, arl_stu, dataverse_pid, …]
    origin : str «new» = elvira | harvest:<slug>
    edition : str «new»
    withdrawn_at : timestamptz «new»
  }
  class Catalog {
    harvestable : bool «new»
  }
}

package "apps.harvest (new)" as harvest {
  interface Connector <<proposed>> <<focus>> {
    name : str
    capabilities : read · write · validate · link
    config_schema : JSON schema
    --
    records(source, cursor, full)
    fetch(source, record_id)
    test(source)
    push(source, record_id, record, expected_version) «write»
    validate(source, record) «validate»
    record_url(source, record_id) «link»
  }
  class ConnectorRegistry <<proposed>> {
    register(connector)
    get(name) : Connector
  }
  class OaiPmhConnector <<proposed>>
  class MarcFileConnector <<proposed>>
  class HarvestSource <<proposed>> {
    slug, name : str
    adapter : connector name
    config : JSON «no secrets»
    system_key : str
    mode : link_only | enrich | create | sync
    field_policy : JSON
    oai_reexpose : bool
    schedule : cron
    cursor : str
    enabled : bool
  }
  class HarvestRecord <<proposed>> {
    record_id : str «unique per source»
    datestamp, deleted, raw_hash
    source_record : JSONB
    status, matched_on, dry_run
    synced_record : JSONB «merge base»
    remote_version, local_version
    sync_state : in_sync | pending | conflict | error
  }
  class HarvestConflict <<proposed>> {
    field : str
    local_value, remote_value : JSON
    local_at, remote_at : timestamptz
    winner : local | remote
    acknowledged : bool
  }
}

package "apps.dataverse (connector only)" as dv {
  class DataverseConnector <<proposed>> {
    client · mapper ⇄ SourceRecord
    webhooks: prepublish, validate
  }
}

Connector <|.. OaiPmhConnector
Connector <|.. MarcFileConnector
Connector <|.. DataverseConnector
ConnectorRegistry o-- "*" Connector : registered
HarvestSource ..> ConnectorRegistry : adapter name
HarvestSource "*" --> "1" Catalog : target_catalog
HarvestSource "1" *-- "*" HarvestRecord : records
HarvestRecord "*" --> "0..1" Entry : entry (SET_NULL)
HarvestRecord "1" *-- "*" HarvestConflict : conflicts
HarvestSource ..> Entry : identifiers[system_key]\n= record_id

legend bottom left
  |= Notation |= Meaning |
  | plain class | existing model (fields marked «new» are added) |
  | dashed, «proposed» | new in IP-034 |
  | dashed arrow | logical link (registry name, identifiers key), not a foreign key |
  | hollow triangle | implements the Connector contract |
endlegend

caption apps/harvest owns the contract, the registry, matching, applying, the three-way merge, conflicts, push and pull; a system only\nimplements Connector. Dataverse registers its connector from apps/dataverse, which apps/harvest never imports. A source may run in sync\nmode only with a connector that can write; its HarvestRecord keeps the state both sides agreed on, which is the merge base.
footer ELVIRA · FIIT STU · EvilFlowersCatalog · docs/diagrams/class-harvest-sync.puml
@enduml
